  "ports": [
    "Original full-size 400x40 SD and 600x60 HD menu textures; source movie scale stretches the whole bitmap, without Java nine-slice borders.",
    "Original list selection uses 400x60 / 600x90 list artwork.",
    "Raw LCE RGB is retained: modal face (111,111,111), selection (126,136,191); no replacement brightness or overlay. Display Gamma still applies to the final frame when enabled.",
    "FJ_MenuButton::Init centers labels; UIController installs the unchanged Mojangles7 bitmap font. Normal/selected/disabled/inactive-selected labels use source white/yellow/204-gray/pale-yellow.",
    "FJ_Button focus and pressed states use the original 30 Hz timeline: fifteen-frame first-focus pulse, eleven-frame press, then selected.",
    "The source disabled states keep the normal texture; no invented gray rectangle is drawn."
  ],
  "adaptations": [
    "Java menu sizes and navigation callbacks are retained, including the requested standard 225x20 logical buttons.",
    "Label ink is centered within the button using the source bitmap bearings and common capital baseline. The zero-blur original black shadow uses source distance 1 at angle 0.785385.",
    "The optional source yellow Outline is disabled by default in FJ_Button and is not added to ordinary menu buttons."
  ]
}
